graphql-resolver-004.example:
```js
// Apollo Server: build context from the incoming request.
const server = new ApolloServer({ typeDefs, resolvers });
await startStandaloneServer(server, {
  context: async ({ req }) => {
    const user = await getUserFromToken(req.headers.authorization);
    return { user, db, loaders: createLoaders(db) };
  },
});
```

graphql-resolver-mcq-001.example:
```graphql
query {
  user(id: "1") {   # 1) resolves the User
    name            # 3) leaf read from the User
    posts {         # 2) gets the User as `parent`
      title         # 4) leaf read from each Post
    }
  }
}
```

